{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - Application - OAuth2 - Okta OAuth2 Client Created or Modified",
	"Description": "An OAuth2 client application was created, modified, or activated, or its credentials were changed. A new OAuth2 client with a client secret the adversary holds is API access to the org that does not depend on any user account.\n\nEvent types: app.oauth2.client.lifecycle.create, app.oauth2.client.lifecycle.update, app.oauth2.client.lifecycle.activate, app.oauth2.credentials.lifecycle.create, app.oauth2.credentials.lifecycle.activate\n\nReference(s):\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/event-types/\n- https://developer.okta.com/docs/reference/api/oauth-clients/",
